  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **New Britain**: back after 77 archived shows (2396 days); rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **Heights**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Fire Editorial**: rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **Blood Capsules**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **MountainGoats2015-06-02.mix.flac16** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 21 songs; 99 min [1]\n- **tmg2015-06-02.gamh**: audience recording; 21 songs; 98 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **MountainGoats2015-06-02.mix.flac16**: taped by anonymous; transferred by BLG; source: [SBD > M10] + [Schoeps CCM4’s (8’ up, board area) > Tinybox > M10] => FLAC [1]. Also: Two sources were combined: a soundboard feed and a Schoeps CCM4 microphone recording, both captured through an M10 recorder; The mics were placed about eight feet up in the board area, running through a Tinybox into the M10; Mastering used Adobe Audition for edits, alignment and mixdown, then iZotope Ozone 5 processing, WavePad tracking, xACT tagging, and FLAC encoding [1]\n- **tmg2015-06-02.gamh**: taped by The Annotated Mountain Goats; source: Audience recording [2]",
